      <bpmn2:documentation id="_8qzAsXoxEfG20Kz8fLTUEg"><![CDATA[Resolve the LOGICAL_PORT of the customer-side SFP (the newest direct or indirect LOGICAL_PORT child of the SFP node). (FIND)]]></bpmn2:documentation>
